crates/lumix (lumix-link) was first written for Picabia (https://github.com/profdl/picabia-vector),
a fork of VectorCraft, under the same MIT OR Apache-2.0 licence, and moved here on 2026-11-07.

The camera protocol comes from public community notes about Panasonic's Wi-Fi remote control and
from probing the owner's own camera. Panasonic doesn't document it, and nothing of Panasonic's
(apps, firmware, artwork) is included.
